 "title": "Massa bilder",
 "date": "2011-07-19T00:18",
 "timestamp": 1311027516,
 "categories": [],
 "tags": [],
 "html": "Ja här kommer en hel drös med bilder från tiden vi har bott här nu i huset. Får bo kvar till åtminstonne fredag i alla fall men sen får man flytta tillbaka hem igen. Sorgligt men sant, fast visst kan det bli lite skönt att slippa laga mat och handla hela tiden.<br/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06402_157886926.jpg\"/><br/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06447_157887347.jpg\"/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06418_157887117.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06494_157887821.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06500_157888093.jpg\"/><br/>Honungsöl blev det när vi taggade inför midnattsvisningen på Harry Potter<br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06466_157887591.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06509_157888346.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06517_157888500.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06525_157888685.jpg\"/><br/>Vi bjöd på hamburgare ;)<br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06535_157888848.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06542_157889020.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06539_157889711.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06544_157889264.jpg\"/><br/>Inte för att man ser så mycket men jag har i alla fall på mig en egensydd gryffindordräkt (A) lite<br/>nördig får man vara på premiären<br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06545_157889471.jpg\"/><br/>Nästa bjudning blev otroligt lyckad och måste verkligen återupprepas. Här kommer kvällen i bilder:<br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06572_157889967.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06581_157890159.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06586_157890343.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06600_157890643.jpg\"/><br/>Min efterätt bestående av hallonmousse och chokladmousse. Muuuums!<br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06612_157890966.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06617_157891543.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06619_157892129.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06624_157892836.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06637_157894401.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06641_157894927.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06660_157895595.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06661_157896274.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06677_157896513.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc06683_157896672.jpg\"/><br/>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/alvert-tag_146465487.jpg\"/></div>",
